            <td height="1413"> 
              <p> <font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b>PMWATCH 
                - May 9, 2002 </b>-- Two American citizens, Dallel Mohamed and 
                Dr. Riad Abdelkarim, were arrested last week by Israeli police. 
                It is unclear why they were arrested.</font>
              </p><p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">According 
                to the story, Ms. Mohamed's attorney "said that she was appealing 
                an Israeli decision barring her from seeing her client, who, like 
                Dr. Abdelkarim, is being held at a prison outside Tel Aviv." 
                Serious concern over the possibility that the two would be subjected 
                to physical and psychological abuse in the hands of the Israeli 
                authorities have been voiced by friends and family.</font>
              </p><p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Please call 
                on the US media to keep an eye on this story.</font>
              </p><p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Your letter 
                will be sent to:</font> 
